WEBVTT

00:00:28.149 --> 00:00:31.402
we are going to be using
supersized spacecraft

00:00:31.402 --> 00:00:33.237
for our journey into the solar system.

00:00:34.113 --> 00:00:35.615
This is the Starship vehicle

00:00:35.615 --> 00:00:37.825
that’s being developed
by the company SpaceX.

00:00:38.409 --> 00:00:41.037
This vehicle will be able
to launch more mass --

00:00:41.037 --> 00:00:42.246
or payload --

00:00:42.246 --> 00:00:43.790
have more power

00:00:43.790 --> 00:00:47.043
and be able to launch over
and over and over again,

00:00:47.043 --> 00:00:51.047
more than any spacecraft
ever designed or built, ever.

00:00:52.173 --> 00:00:54.842
So the Starship
and its Super Heavy booster

00:00:54.842 --> 00:00:57.678
are a fully reusable
transportation system.

00:00:58.304 --> 00:01:01.349
So that means that you don’t
have to build a new vehicle